WUFFS_CONFIG__FUZZLIB_MAIN will let you manually run fuzz over a set of files:

gcc -DWUFFS_CONFIG__FUZZLIB_MAIN zlib_fuzzer.c
./a.out ../../../test/data/*.zlib
rm -f ./a.out

It should print "PASS", amongst other information, and exit(0).
